    "id": "ld-110-1-2-8-fill-1",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "下列哪一組數無法作為直角三角形的三邊長？答：＿＿＿＿。"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$\\sqrt1$、$\\sqrt2$、$\\sqrt3$",
          "3、4、5",
          "$3^2$、$4^2$、$5^2$",
          "5、12、13"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "c32b594419f0c59267c9774e285b48761594707f6a859767f8f505c9469fecaf"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-110-1-2-8-fill-2",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知 $2x^2+10x+12=2(x+2)(x+3)$，則下列哪些式子是 $2x^2+10x+12$ 的因式？答：＿＿＿＿。"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$x+3$",
          "$2x+6$",
          "$2x+4$",
          "$2x+2$",
          "$2x^2+10x+12$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "c32b594419f0c59267c9774e285b48761594707f6a859767f8f505c9469fecaf"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-110-1-2-8-fill-3-1",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "計算並化為最簡根式：$\\sqrt6\\times\\sqrt{\\frac73}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "c32b594419f0c59267c9774e285b48761594707f6a859767f8f505c9469fecaf"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-110-1-2-8-fill-3-2",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "計算並化為最簡根式：$\\frac{\\sqrt3}{\\sqrt5}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "c32b594419f0c59267c9774e285b48761594707f6a859767f8f505c9469fecaf"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-110-1-2-8-fill-3-3",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "計算並化為最簡根式：$(\\sqrt6+3)^2(\\sqrt6-3)^2=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "c32b594419f0c59267c9774e285b48761594707f6a859767f8f505c9469fecaf"
  },
  {
    "id": "ld-110-1-2-8-fill-3-4",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "計算並化為最簡根式：$\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2+\\sqrt3}+\\frac{\\sqrt3+\\sqrt2}{\\sqrt3-\\sqrt2}=$＿＿＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "c32b594419f0c59267c9774e285b48761594707f6a859767f8f505c9469fecaf"
  },
  {
